{title: Leap of Faith}
{lyricist: Sergio Rykov}
{composer: Sergio Rykov}

{start_of_verse}
A step to the unknown, a step into space.
I feel the road with my skin. I go
With hope and with faith, afraid as I go,
I don't turn back, I go to meet it.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
How many doubts have passed me by,
How many times the heart has burned,
With fruitless fears while wide awake,
Only the waking world keeps us going.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
It beats like a heart, the fire of dreams,
Gently and tremblingly warms. At times
Again and again it rises in waves,
In colours so bright above the water.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: label="Interlude"}
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: label="Chorus"}
A moment of sadness came and went,
The old and the new are now all one.
The masks are thrown off, no falseness left -
I'm holding my ticket firm in my hand.
{end_of_chorus}
